text @[Sunohara]
text What?
text @[Tomoya]
text Didn't you go after that guy who ignored Fuko?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH15B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 4QS.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Yeah...
text Sunohara answers me vaguely as if hesitant to say something.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Did something happen?
sound 4QT.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text That guy just said some crazy shit. Too much of a bother to explain.
text I'm not sure I want to hear what he has to say next.
text But if I don't ask him now, I will never know what really is happening.
text And in the end, we may end up wasting the precious time that has been given to us.
text @[Tomoya]
text Tell me in detail.
text I gather up my courage and say to him.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH16B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH16B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 4QU.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Such a pain...
text @[Tomoya]
text Just do it!
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH18B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH18B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 4QV.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text I got it, I got it. I'll tell you, so just calm down.
sound 4QW.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text I'm going to tell you everything that happened that day.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH15B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 4QX.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text The guy who ignored Fuko... His name was Sonobe. The thing is, he said he didn't remember being approached by Fuko.
sound 4QY.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Even though she was right next to him.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Maybe he just wasn't paying attention when Fuko called out to him.
sound 4QZ.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text No, that's not it. He recognized me there.
sound 4R0.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Apparently, he didn't want to go near "the troublesome guy."
text @[Tomoya]
text Maybe that's what distracted him.
sound 4R1.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Nope. He even saw Nagisa-chan, who was standing next to Fuko.
sound 4R2.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text In other words, the only one he couldn't see was Fuko.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 4R3.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Listen, Okazaki. Here is the question.
sound 4R4.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Whose head is the funny one here?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I think I know the answer to that question.
text No one's head is funny.
text Everyone says what's true to them.
sound 4R5.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Mine? Or Sonobe's? Or all ours?
text @[Tomoya]
text Stop, Sunohara. No one gives a damn about that.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH18B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH18B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
