text But I don't know... how to deal with this anger.
text @[Tomoya]
text At what?
sound 4R8.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text The way he said it... It's as if Fuko-chan was a ghost or something.
text @[Tomoya]
text If you put it that way...
text @[Tomoya]
text You know what? Don't think too much about it.
